comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-08T18:17:52.825Z","harness:claude-code","Scope note from the CodeRabbit review of PR 1688. 'pm files discover <id> --note \"context\" --output-limit 5' is a read-only preview without --apply, yet read_output_mutation_conflict refuses it. HYBRID_READ_MUTATION_KEYS has listed note as a files mutation key since before PR 1688, and discover mode is not distinguished. Once files discover has its own contract entry, the guard can treat note as a mutation only together with --apply."
